<!-- ─── HERO ─── -->
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Bahrain</span>
  <h1>UK technology. Built for Bahrain's digital economy.</h1>
  <p>Manama · Across Bahrain</p>
  <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:16px;color:#c4d2e4;max-width:760px">BTS helps organisations in Bahrain build connected, intelligent digital systems — combining AI automation, custom software, business intelligence, cloud integration and Arabic-English technology.</p>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 1: WHY BTS IN BAHRAIN ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Why BTS in Bahrain</span>
    <h2>A technology partner for Bahrain's digital economy</h2>
    <p>Six things we bring that make the difference.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Digital finance &amp; professional services</h3><p>Technology for financial services, fintech, professional services and digitally driven organisations.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Trusted AI &amp; automation</h3><p>Practical AI for document processing, workflow automation, customer support, reporting and operational intelligence.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Cloud-connected systems</h3><p>Modern cloud architectures, APIs and integrations designed to connect existing platforms and data.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Arabic-English by design</h3><p>Bilingual interfaces, RTL support, workflows and documentation for organisations serving Arabic and English users.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>UK-based. Bahrain-focused.</h3><p>UK technology expertise delivered remotely from Glasgow, with flexible engagement for organisations across Bahrain.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Responsible AI adoption</h3><p>Practical AI with appropriate human oversight, data handling and integration.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 2: TECHNOLOGY FOR BAHRAIN'S DIGITAL ECONOMY ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Bahrain's digital economy</span>
    <h2>Technology for Bahrain's digital economy</h2>
    <p>Bahrain's National Digital Economy Strategy aims to strengthen the Kingdom as an integrated digital economic hub and promote innovation across key sectors. Current national initiatives also focus on advanced technologies, AI, cloud adoption, data and digital governance. BTS builds practical technology around these priorities.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <a class="svc" href="../services/ai-automation.html"><h3>AI Automation</h3><p>Automate document processing, approvals, customer workflows, reporting and repetitive business tasks.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
    <a class="svc" href="../services/business-intelligence.html"><h3>Business Intelligence</h3><p>Turn business and operational data into dashboards, analytics, alerts and actionable insight.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
    <a class="svc" href="../services/custom-software.html"><h3>Custom Software</h3><p>Build portals, internal platforms and business applications around your organisation's processes.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
    <a class="svc" href="../services/bilingual-systems.html"><h3>Bilingual Systems</h3><p>Arabic-English platforms with RTL support and bilingual workflows.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
    <a class="svc" href="../services/system-integration.html"><h3>System Integration</h3><p>Connect APIs, ERP, CRM, databases and cloud applications into a more unified technology environment.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
    <a class="svc" href="../services/logistics-warehouse.html"><h3>Logistics &amp; Warehouse</h3><p>Digitise inventory, warehouse, shipment and supply-chain workflows.</p><span class="svc-link">Learn more</span></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

