<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">AI that connects with your business</span>
    <h2>From data to trusted action</h2>
    <p>BTS can help organisations introduce AI into existing workflows while keeping people, processes, data and controls connected.</p>
  </div>
