<!-- ─── SECTION 4: INDUSTRIES ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Industries</span>
    <h2>Built for Bahrain's digitally driven sectors</h2>
    <p>Sector-focused systems built for Bahrain's digital economy.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Financial Services &amp; FinTech</h3><p>AI-assisted workflows, document intelligence, customer operations, reporting, dashboards and system integration.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Professional Services</h3><p>Client portals, document automation, CRM integration, workflow systems and business intelligence.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Retail &amp; Commerce</h3><p>Order management, customer workflows, analytics and bilingual digital platforms.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Logistics &amp; Supply Chain</h3><p>Warehouse systems, shipment workflows, inventory visibility and operational intelligence.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Government &amp; Public Services</h3><p>Digital workflows, information management, dashboards, integration and AI-assisted processes.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Technology &amp; Digital Businesses</h3><p>Cloud-connected platforms, APIs, custom software, automation and scalable digital infrastructure.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 5: CLOUD + DATA + AI ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Cloud + Data + AI</span>
    <h2>Bahrain's cloud-first direction, delivered practically</h2>
    <p>Bahrain has a long-standing government focus on cloud adoption and digital transformation, including a Cloud First approach and continued development of integrated digital services. BTS brings these capabilities together:</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Cloud</h3><p>Cloud-connected platforms designed for scale and resilience.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>APIs</h3><p>Interfaces that connect systems, data and services.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Data</h3><p>Pipelines, dashboards and operational analytics.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>AI</h3><p>Document intelligence, assistants and automation.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Automation</h3><p>Workflow automation, approvals and document routing.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Business Intelligence</h3><p>Dashboards, alerts and decision-grade insight.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Arabic + English</h3><p>Bilingual enterprise systems with native RTL support.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 6: RESPONSIBLE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head" style="text-align:center">
    <span class="kicker">Trusted AI adoption</span>
    <h2>Built for responsible digital transformation</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-band">
    <h3>AI should be applied, not just adopted</h3>
    <p>BTS focuses on practical applications where AI can improve a defined workflow, process or business outcome — with appropriate human oversight, data handling and integration.</p>
    <p>This approach aligns with Bahrain's current emphasis on responsible AI adoption, data protection and digital governance.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 7: UK TECHNOLOGY. BAHRAIN-FOCUSED DELIVERY. ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
