    <h2>UK technology. Bahrain-focused delivery.</h2>
    <p>BTS combines UK technology expertise with digital systems designed for organisations operating in Bahrain and the wider GCC.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="svc"><h3>AI</h3><p>Automation, document intelligence and intelligent workflows.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Software</h3><p>Custom platforms, portals and internal systems.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Cloud</h3><p>Cloud-connected platforms and integrations.</p></div>
